{"id":"eb7be9972d7be6ba","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-finite-extension-coding.md","title":"任意集合的有限延伸编码范式","display":"thm-finite-extension-coding — 任意集合的有限延伸编码范式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-finite-extension-coding","aliases":["20-thm-finite-extension-coding"],"display":"thm-finite-extension-coding — 任意集合的有限延伸编码范式","chapter":"14","section":"14.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 14.2.2（统一 A 与 f 的记号）","source_printed_pages":[215],"source_pdf_pages":[244],"depends_on":["[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-thm-1gen-low]]","[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-finite-extension-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-finite-extension-coding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-extension-coding — 任意集合的有限延伸编码范式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 14.2.2（统一 A 与 f 的记号）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>244</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8a59ed3a01d1c804\" href=\"?note=8a59ed3a01d1c804\" title=\"20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm\">20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_e)\">\\(V=(V_e)\\)</span> 为统一 c.e. 串序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 任意；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。对串序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(\\sigma_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\(S=(\\sigma_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_S(e)=\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma_e)\">\\(g_S(e)=\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma_e)\\)</span>；函数的 Turing 归约通过其配对函数图编码解释。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8a59ed3a01d1c804\" href=\"?note=8a59ed3a01d1c804\" title=\"20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm\">20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<p>“统一 c.e. 串序列”表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformCE}((\\operatorname{code}[V_e])_{e\\in\\omega})\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformCE}((\\operatorname{code}[V_e])_{e\\in\\omega})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_S(e)=\\operatorname{code}(S(e))\">\\(g_S(e)=\\operatorname{code}(S(e))\\)</span> 对每个被量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}extension\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\n\\exists S=(\\sigma_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\in(2^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\\ \\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\sigma_e\\prec\\sigma_{e+1},\\qquad G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e,\\\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [ (\\exists\\rho\\preceq G\\ \\rho\\in V_e)\n\\lor(\\exists\\rho\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\rho\\ \\tau\\notin V_e)],\\\\\ng_S\\le_T B\\oplus K\\land g_S\\le_TG\\oplus K\\land B\\le_Tg_S,\\qquad\nG\\oplus K\\equiv_TB\\oplus K,\\\\\n\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{code}[V_e]=W_e\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\land G&#39;\\equiv_TB\\oplus K\\bigr)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}extension\\text{-}coding}\\vdash\n\\exists S=(\\sigma_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\in(2^{&lt;\\omega})^\\omega\\ \\exists G\\in2^\\omega\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\sigma_e\\prec\\sigma_{e+1},\\qquad G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e,\\\\\n\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ [ (\\exists\\rho\\preceq G\\ \\rho\\in V_e)\n\\lor(\\exists\\rho\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\rho\\ \\tau\\notin V_e)],\\\\\ng_S\\le_T B\\oplus K\\land g_S\\le_TG\\oplus K\\land B\\le_Tg_S,\\qquad\nG\\oplus K\\equiv_TB\\oplus K,\\\\\n\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{code}[V_e]=W_e\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{1Generic}(G)\\land G&#39;\\equiv_TB\\oplus K\\bigr)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿范式构造，在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span> 作同一规范搜索，得扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_e\">\\(\\rho_e\\)</span>，无见证时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_e=\\sigma_e\">\\(\\rho_e=\\sigma_e\\)</span>；然后定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{e+1}=\\rho_e^\\frown B(e)\">\\(\\sigma_{e+1}=\\rho_e^\\frown B(e)\\)</span>。见证或避开性质在继续延伸后保留，长度严格增长。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\oplus K\">\\(B\\oplus K\\)</span> 计算全部串，给第一个上界；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_S\">\\(g_S\\)</span> 读出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{e+1}\">\\(\\sigma_{e+1}\\)</span> 最后一位得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span>，并用长度增长计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>解码时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\oplus K\">\\(G\\oplus K\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0\">\\(\\sigma_0\\)</span> 起，用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 判断和固定搜索重建 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_e\">\\(\\rho_e\\)</span>，再读 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(|\\rho_e|)\">\\(G(|\\rho_e|)\\)</span> 恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(e)\">\\(B(e)\\)</span>，从而重建下一串。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_T G\\oplus K\">\\(B\\le_T G\\oplus K\\)</span>，并给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_S\">\\(g_S\\)</span> 第二个上界及两项 join 等价。全体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 情形正是 1-generic，GL₁ 性质再给最后的跳跃等价。</p>\n<p>原书公式 (14.6) 及 (ii) 在同一段交替使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,f\">\\(A,f\\)</span>；本原子始终用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 表示结果，不引入未绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\ge_T K\">\\(B\\ge_T K\\)</span> 不是这里的必要假设。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 215 / PDF 244。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm","status":"resolved","id":"8a59ed3a01d1c804","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-1gen-low","status":"resolved","id":"bc7d5064491f1d37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-1gen-low]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":""